# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan Revision Update Improvements v3<br>
<br>
## Abstract<br>
<br>
This revision updates our previous research plan to incorporate new information from recent studies. The focus is on sustainable materials and production methods in the fashion industry.<br>
<br>
### Key Changes<br>
<br>
*   Incorporating more environmentally friendly materials<br>
*   Exploring alternative production methods with reduced waste<br>
*   Collaborating with local designers and manufacturers for sustainable practices<br>
<br>
## Methodology<br>
<br>
*   Literature review of recent studies on sustainable fashion practices<br>
*   Interviews with local designers and manufacturers to explore sustainable options<br>
*   Analysis of environmental impact of current production methods<br>
<br>
### Expected Outcomes<br>
<br>
*   Development of a comprehensive guide for sustainable fashion practices in the industry<br>
*   Increased adoption of environmentally friendly materials and production methods among designers and manufacturers<br>
```<br>
